Error: Jet.StaticOnlyStruct: `Geometry` has no fields, and every function in it is static
  --> Tests/UI/static_only_struct.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | Geometry: struct {
    | ^^^^^^^^
 Why: No value of `Geometry` carries anything and no function here takes or returns one, so the struct only groups functions under a type name, which is what a module is for
 Fix: Replace `Geometry: struct` with a `name: module { … }` block holding the same functions, and call them through the module's name
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.StaticOnlyStruct
